=== Test 1: Generic identity ===
identity<int>(42) = 42
identity<double>(3.14) = 3.14
=== Test 2: Generic max ===
max<int>(10, 20) = 20
max<double>(2.71, 3.14) = 3.14
=== Test 3: Generic add ===
add<int>(15, 27) = 42
add<double>(1.5, 2.5) = 4.0
=== Test 4: Multiple type params ===
first<int,double>(42, 3.14) = 42
=== Test 5: Reuse same instantiation ===
max<int>(5, 3) = 5 (cached)
